.png", "id": "3915626092078551", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296127_3915626095411884_5364719753103044987_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qaauz6_3U20Q7kNvwEEZzZI&_nc_oc=AdrpakIl1a6PrcDxSagxsn6XZr5F0qB0fKjcR88NPOWZqQHki9VUPK-gk70hoGhn0I8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHZE061CuTsZgYpmE0Vr-xnqcTjQmQZ0tUZrAy04jfCzw&oe=6A7EF91A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Blade City Brand Assets Cover.png", "id": "1655153859945519", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1655153863278852_7997685239185590787_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mAD7Tb7torMQ7kNvwHCv0Ac&_nc_oc=AdocAEHzIGgmpJ7BTtlB6K5QekoUQKZT9V8gvWKr-Cuyc5PgPMc6TpUKtUhouGXBUNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFOergAVshnjOvskyU3_s-oHF4CSwl0ok_2CcBCru78lQ&oe=6A7EFC51"}, "display_name": "Blade City", "keywords": ["sports", "social", "sandbox", "platformer"], "long_description": "A rookie Ninja Monkey with a rusty blade, an empty wallet, and one impossible dream...to become the Master of the Blades \ud83e\udd77\n\nDodge & deflex \u2694\ufe0f in every match to win coins \ud83d\udcb0 \n\nSpend coins to upgrade blades, slay-high abilities, aura \u2728\n\nCoins also unlock mini-games across the city \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\n\nSkate. Slice. Socialize \ud83d\udef9 \ud83c\udf54  \ud83c\udf63 \n\nGet rich\ud83d\udcb0. Get jacked \ud83d\udcaa. Throw rooftop parties \ud83c\udf89 . Flex \ud83e\udea9\n{1899581750729344}\n\n{2088024375447461}\n\nWanna help us build arena maps, blades, and expand this Ninja City? \ud83e\udd1d\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f\n\nJoin discord.gg/playbladecity\n\n{1714375429586515}", "short_description": "Become the ultimate Ninja Monkey in Blade City! \ud83e\udd77\ud83d\udc35\nYou have a blade. Everyone else has a blade. Good luck! \u2694\ufe0f"}]}, "developer_name": "Blade Lab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Blade Lab", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/playbladecity", "website_url": "https://bladecityvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1614607460665188"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2372246093265216"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1781905200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2372246093265216"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1682809240511676", "version": "1.0.11a"}, "id": "2403174663506544", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1682809240511676"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.11 \u2014 Grid Clash Update New Game Mode \u2014 Grid Clash\n\n*  Hit the giant balls to paint the grid in your team\u2019s color. Claim more tiles than the opposing team before time runs out. \n* Vote for 'Team Mode' to play Grid Clash. \n\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Warpath\n\n* Objective: Get 2 or more kills in a single match, 15 times this week.\n* Reward: Crimson Kurogane\n\nForged from the wreckage of destroyed robots and tempered through real battles.\n\nNew Blades \u2014 Kurogane Collection\nThe new Kurogane blade series has arrived in Crimson, Azure, and Emerald.\nBuilt from salvaged robot parts, these heavy industrial blades carry the scars and energy of battle.\n\nImprovements & Balance Changes\n\n* Sky Break\n    * Reduced Sky Break\u2019s jump height. It still provides strong vertical mobility, but should feel less extreme and create fewer unfair shortcuts around the city.\n* Dance Mode\n    * Added a mirror ball to the Dance arena to make each round feel more like a real dance party.\n* Zipline Glitch\n    * Fixed an issue that allowed players to grab the lobby zipline during an active match and fly above the arena.\n* Voice Chat Reconnection\n    * Fixing the problem so voice chat reconnects properly", "created_date": 1786324974, "id": "1682809240511676", "version": "1.0.11a", "version_code": 118, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1682809240511676"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786084310, "id": "1680125170780083", "version": "1.0.11", "version_code": 110, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1682809240511676"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "v1.0.11 \u2014 Grid Clash Update New Game Mode \u2014 Grid Clash\n\n*  Hit the giant balls to paint the grid in your team\u2019s color. Claim more tiles than the opposing team before time runs out. \n* Vote for 'Team Mode' to play Grid Clash. \n\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Warpath\n\n* Objective: Get 2 or more kills in a single match, 15 times this week.\n* Reward: Crimson Kurogane\n\nForged from the wreckage of destroyed robots and tempered through real battles.\n\nNew Blades \u2014 Kurogane Collection\nThe new Kurogane blade series has arrived in Crimson, Azure, and Emerald.\nBuilt from salvaged robot parts, these heavy industrial blades carry the scars and energy of battle.\n\nImprovements & Balance Changes\n\n* Sky Break\n    * Reduced Sky Break\u2019s jump height. It still provides strong vertical mobility, but should feel less extreme and create fewer unfair shortcuts around the city.\n* Dance Mode\n    * Added a mirror ball to the Dance arena to make each round feel more like a real dance party.\n* Zipline Glitch\n    * Fixed an issue that allowed players to grab the lobby zipline during an active match and fly above the arena.", "created_date": 1785989345, "id": "1679057980886802", "version": "1.0.11", "version_code": 109, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols